# 🎨 UI / Google Stitch Prompt: [Feature Name] (`[NN-feature-slug]`)

> **How to Use:**
> 1. **Personal / New UI (Google Stitch):** Copy the prompt block below into [Google Stitch](https://stitch.withgoogle.com/) (or v0 / Figma AI). Once happy with the design, export the **screenshot (`01-<screen>.png`)** and **HTML/Tailwind code (`01-<screen>.html`)** into this folder (`docs/specs/[NN-feature-slug]/design-reference/`).
> 2. **Client Already Has Designs:** Simply drop the client's Figma/wireframe screenshots (`*.png` / `*.jpg`) into this folder (`docs/specs/[NN-feature-slug]/design-reference/`) and run `/spec` or `/build`.

---

## Screen 1 Prompt — `[Primary Screen Name]` (Copy-Paste into Stitch)

```text
Design a [desktop web / mobile-first web / WordPress admin] screen for "[PROJECT NAME]" — [1-sentence product summary].

SCREEN PURPOSE:
[Describe what the user accomplishes on this screen, based on requirements.md]

VISUAL DIRECTION & DESIGN TOKENS (from docs/foundation/design-system.md):
- Visual Tone: [e.g., Clean & Minimal / Bold & Modern / Enterprise]
- Mode: [Light / Dark]
- Background Primary: [HEX] | Surface / Card: [HEX] | Border: [HEX]
- Text Primary: [HEX] | Text Muted: [HEX]
- Primary Brand Accent: [HEX] | Secondary / Status Accents: [HEX]
- Typography: Heading font [Font Name], Body font [Font Name], Monospace [Font Name]
- Border Radius & Density: [e.g., 8px rounded-lg, compact 16px/24px card padding]

LAYOUT & KEY COMPONENTS (Mapped to EARS Requirements):
1. Header / Context Bar: [Title, breadcrumbs, primary action button]
2. Primary Section ([Req 1.1]): [Exact inputs, dropzone, filters, or data table columns]
3. Secondary / Results Section ([Req 1.2]): [Preview card, score badges, status indicators]
4. Interactive States ([Req 1.3]): Show clear inline validation error state, loading skeleton/spinner state, and empty state.

CONSTRAINTS:
- Do NOT include out-of-scope elements: [list Non-Goals from requirements.md]
- Keep layout clean, high-contrast, and scannable.
```

